{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-16T14:40:51.350Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"732899a8c3306ebf8248e146","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"ops-3wrp"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Parallel jobs must not replace the shared global npm"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Deep and release workflows install the pinned npm globally after setup-node. On the shared local runners every container on a host shares the toolcache Node installation, so parallel jobs replace the same npm and fail with ENOTEMPTY or npm: command not found. GitHub issue unbraind/pm-ops#284."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-16T14:40:51.350Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-16T14:40:51.350Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"pi-glm"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Every workflow installs the pinned npm with --prefix into a job-local directory and prepends its bin to the job path, keeping the exact-version assertion; A workflow-contract test fails if any workflow replaces the global npm; A regression test runs two overlapping pinned installs into separate prefixes against one shared Node directory and proves both stay at the pin with the shared npm untouched"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"77eb98642496cc83df129f34c211452f1e9457cb6c05876809d8e9b567a01b61","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","event_cla